OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA partly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with showers,
OL,7,Fpotentially heavy and thundery in
OL,8,Fplaces. Most places staying dry
OL,9,Fovernight with only an isolated light
OL,10,Fshower. Cool overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA partly cloudy start with
OL,13,Fisolated showers. Showers becoming
OL,14,Fmore widespread and turning heavy and
OL,15,Fperhaps thundery through the morning
OL,16,Fand afternoon, easing again later.
OL,17,FNear average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
